Question 20 — JOIN Interview

Find the department name and average salary of employees whose salary is at least 40,000, including only departments that have matching employees.
 SELECT d.dept_name, AVG(e.salary) AS average_salary
    -> FROM employees e
    -> JOIN departments d
    -> ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id
    -> WHERE e.salary >= 40000
    -> GROUP BY d.dept_name;
+-----------+----------------+
| dept_name | average_salary |
+-----------+----------------+
| IT        |     50000.0000 |
| HR        |     40000.0000 |
| FINANCE   |     55000.0000 |
| MARKETING |     45000.0000 |
